            {
                "entry_id": "b19d5971-026d-3138-bdf1-6e00379c9461",
                "word": "tenon",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "cb3b7624-1c21-4140-89f9-bdd878c11bb3",
                        "entry_id": "b19d5971-026d-3138-bdf1-6e00379c9461",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "tenons"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                        "entry_id": "b19d5971-026d-3138-bdf1-6e00379c9461",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A projecting member left by cutting away the wood around it, and made to insert into a mortise, and in this way secure together the parts of a frame."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9dce659e-5256-4776-8490-7a5ce88ba3b4",
                                "sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                                "text": "A keyed mortise-and-tenon joint is constructed the same as a doweled mortise and tenon joint except that the tenon projects far enough through the mortise to admit the insertion of a tapering key which draws the mortised piece firmly against the shoulder of the tenon."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97ab3ae7-f7ba-4ec2-8be1-2254292c49ee",
                                "sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                                "text": "One soon learned, however, that it was no easy thing to make wood do exactly as one required it. It looked quite easy in the masterly hands of the experienced pattern-maker, but the mysteries of dowelling and mortice and tenon were not uncovered in a week or two."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "17177ff1-b779-40e8-b371-ac22a4bc6bef",
                                "sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                                "text": "If there is much gauging for the same size mortise and tenon to be done, and if a mortise gauge is not handy, a simple improvised gauge for the purpose can easily be made with two pieces of wood and four or five steel sprigs…"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "689d0bec-4a52-40e0-bce6-97c6cfc0dcc2",
                        "source_entry_id": "b19d5971-026d-3138-bdf1-6e00379c9461",
                        "source_sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                        "source_sense_description": "projecting member left by cutting away the wood around it",
                        "target_lang_word": "čep",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "čep",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e31d146b-b045-3595-bd22-3e839270e701",
                                        "entry_id": "33dfa63c-864c-328a-afde-6941a0004759",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nástroj k mlácení obilí ve formě tyče volně připevněné k dlouhé násadě, sekundárně používán též jako zbraň"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "64c35b84-34e5-4af8-bee9-cf913d3a080d",
                                                "sense_id": "e31d146b-b045-3595-bd22-3e839270e701",
                                                "text": "A cep štíhlý — pěkný junák jak se vzduchem kmitá, koukol, vika, černé zrní nad hlavy až lítá!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "af3a5600-aa80-4d0c-9315-e2fcac8df9da",
                                                "sense_id": "e31d146b-b045-3595-bd22-3e839270e701",
                                                "text": "Jak směšné byly našich předků cepy, když celý svět se zdvihl proti nim, a hle! svět celý zdrtil vůdce slepý a Táboru se klonil věčný Řím."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4942595-239a-4751-93bb-e0db78127614",
                                                "sense_id": "e31d146b-b045-3595-bd22-3e839270e701",
                                                "text": "Ale marně svištěly šípy, marně kamení pršelo, marně cepy bouchaly, každý útok obléhajících sedláků zmařen byl zástupy, které pan kastelán po hradbách rozestavil."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "782e9581-ea77-435d-b351-74ee4ac5b784",
                        "source_entry_id": "b19d5971-026d-3138-bdf1-6e00379c9461",
                        "source_sense_id": "26c3e28c-b601-34a2-b214-95e92e28ba7a",
                        "source_sense_description": "projecting member left by cutting away the wood around it",
